<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in June.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in June.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published the following data relating to M3 money supply in June. AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	  Jun97  May97  Jun96 EndJun</p>
<p>								     Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)	     + 9.4  +23.9  +15.6   4910.5</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	 +-0.0  +-0.0  +-0.0	8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		+ 9.4  +23.9  +15.6   4901.8</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals   +27.4  +17.4  +15.9   3725.3</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     short term lending	  +18.6   +4.0  +14.5    622.7</p>
<p>    To public authorities	-17.9  + 6.5  - 0.3   1176.6</p>
<p>2) NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK	    +17.1  -15.0  +21.1    267.2</p>
<p>3) MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>   FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL+12.9  + 9.8  +10.1   2834.8</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>     4 yrs and more		 +0.7   +3.6   +5.0   818.4</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>   notice, savings certificates -1.1   -1.9   -2.6   491.9</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>     in circulation		 +7.1  + 6.5   +4.1  1173.4</p>
<p>4) DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		+0.9   -0.5   +0,2     1.1</p>
<p>5) OTHER FACTORS		   +12.6  -14.7  +21.2   191.5</p>
<p>6) MONEY STOCK M3		  +0.1   +14.4  + 5.2  2150.3</p>
<p> Currency in circulation	 -0.6   + 0.6  - 0.1   245.6</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		+14.2   + 8.0  +12.0   627.5</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs -13.0   + 3.3  -10.8   386.4</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>     three months notice	- 0.4   + 2.4  + 4.1   890.8</p>
